OL,3,GNEWSAConcern over maternity unit move  
OL,4,Aprompts extra paramedic funding        
OL,6,FExtra paramedic shifts are to be funded
OL,7,Fto relieve pressure on ambulances after
OL,8,Fthe suspension of maternity services at
OL,9,FNewry's Daisy Hill Hospital, MLAs have 
OL,10,Fheard.                                 
OL,12,FOn Monday, the Southern Health Trust   
OL,13,Fmoved all of its hospital-based births 
OL,14,Fto Craigavon Area Hospital because of a
OL,15,Fshortage of consultant obstretricians. 
OL,17,FThe chief executive of the Northern    
OL,18,FIreland Ambulance Service (NIAS) has   
OL,19,Fsince expressed concern that the move  
OL,20,Fwill put "additional pressure" on an   
OL,21,Farea that already has a "poor ambulance
OL,22,Fperformance".                          
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
