OL,3,GNEWSAConcern over maternity unit move  
OL,4,Aprompts extra paramedic funding        
OL,6,FJenny Keane said NIAS has been offered 
OL,7,Fextra resources to address the issue,  
OL,8,Fbut added the money would only cover   
OL,9,Fextra paramedic shifts, not more       
OL,10,Fambulances.                            
